<title>UK: CRICKET-SOMERSET 284 AND 147-3 V AUSTRALIA 323 - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOMERSET 284 AND 147-3 V AUSTRALIA 323 - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>TAUNTON, England 1997-08-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Somerset were 147-3 in</p>
<p>their second innings at close of play on the second day of the</p>
<p>four-day match against Australia on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scores: Somerset 284 and 147-3, Australia 323.</p>
</text>
